message: "If you use VesselNav-Bench or this simulator in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "VesselNav-Bench: a transparent benchmark for autonomous vessel navigation"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-14
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20689528
authors:
  - family-names: "Ravendranathan"
    given-names: "Vishnu"
repository-code: "https://github.com/captv89/autonomous-vessel-navigation"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - autonomous surface vessels
  - COLREGs
  - collision avoidance
  - reinforcement learning
  - benchmark
abstract: >
  A 2D autonomous ship navigation simulator and frozen, seeded benchmark
  (VesselNav-Bench) for comparing classical and learning-based navigation
  policies under identical physics, scenarios, and ground-truth scoring,
  with per-decision transparency for both paradigms.
